#. module: fitness_subscriptions
#: model:sale.subscription.plan,name:fitness_subscriptions.subscription_plan_quarter
msgid "Quarterly"
msgstr "Trimestral"

#. module: fitness_subscriptions
#: model:product.template,description_sale:fitness_subscriptions.product_barre_clase_fija_1
msgid "One fixed weekly Barre slot, reserved just for you every week. The easiest way to build a lasting habit."
msgstr "Un horari fix setmanal de Barre, reservat només per a tu cada setmana. La manera més senzilla de crear un hàbit durador."

#. module: fitness_subscriptions
#: model:product.template,description_sale:fitness_subscriptions.product_barre_clase_fija_2
msgid "Two fixed weekly Barre slots, reserved just for you every week. Twice the rhythm, twice the progress."
msgstr "Dos horaris fixos setmanals de Barre, reservats només per a tu cada setmana. El doble de ritme, el doble de progrés."

#. module: fitness_subscriptions
#: model:product.template,description_sale:fitness_subscriptions.product_barre_ilimitado
msgid "Unlimited Barre classes every month. Come as often as you like — no caps, no counting credits."
msgstr "Classes de Barre il·limitades cada mes. Vine tan sovint com vulguis — sense límits, sense comptar crèdits."

#. module: fitness_subscriptions
#: model:product.template,description_sale:fitness_subscriptions.product_barre_ilimitado_promo
msgid "Unlimited Barre classes every month at our introductory price. The best way to build the habit before committing long-term."
msgstr "Classes de Barre il·limitades cada mes al nostre preu introductori. La millor manera de crear l’hàbit abans de comprometre’t a llarg termini."

#. module: fitness_subscriptions
#: model:product.template,description_sale:fitness_subscriptions.product_reformer_mensual_1
msgid "One Reformer class every week, on your own recurring day and time. A steady rhythm without the commitment of more."
msgstr "Una classe de Reformer cada setmana, en el teu propi dia i horari recurrent. Un ritme constant sense el compromiís de més."

#. module: fitness_subscriptions
#: model:product.template,description_sale:fitness_subscriptions.product_reformer_mensual_2
msgid "Two Reformer classes every week, on your own recurring days and times. Build real strength with consistent practice."
msgstr "Dues classes de Reformer cada setmana, en els teus propis dies i horaris recurrents. Desenvolupa força real amb una pràctica constant."

#. module: fitness_subscriptions
#: model:product.template,description_sale:fitness_subscriptions.product_reformer_mensual_3
msgid "Three Reformer classes every week, on your own recurring days and times. For those ready to make Reformer a core part of their routine."
msgstr "Tres classes de Reformer cada setmana, en els teus propis dies i horaris recurrents. Per a les que estan llestes per fer del Reformer una part essencial de la seva rutina."

